# Build context for `docker build -f ebb_server/Dockerfile .`
#
# Allow-list: everything is excluded, then the build inputs are added
# back. A new top-level tree therefore stays out of the context without
# anyone editing this file.
*
!ebb_server
!scripts
!scripts/setup-ebb-server.sh

# Project parts the image never reads: test and bench are not compiled
# under MIX_ENV=prod (`elixirc_paths(:prod)` is ["lib"]), and the host's
# build output must never reach a layer. The builder fetches, compiles,
# and assembles its own.
ebb_server/_build
ebb_server/deps
ebb_server/test
ebb_server/bench
ebb_server/data
ebb_server/erl_crash.dump
ebb_server/*.md
ebb_server/openapi.yaml
ebb_server/.tool-versions

# The other scripts are developer tooling, not build inputs.
scripts/*
!scripts/setup-ebb-server.sh
